{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002897","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002897"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002897","label":"文王（孔子世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"文王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0118","c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0158","c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0182","c-shiji-047-kong:m050-0155"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0118","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p022","quote":"文王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0158","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p034","quote":"文王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0182","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p034","quote":"文王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m050-0155","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p050","quote":"文王"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002897","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002897","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m034-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002897","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m050-0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002897","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p050","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji047-075","person_id":"cbr-p002897","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["文王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p022","quote":"將適陳，過匡，顏刻為僕，以其策指之曰：「昔吾入此，由彼缺也。」匡人聞之，以為魯之陽虎。陽虎嘗暴匡人，匡人於是遂止孔子。孔子狀類陽虎，拘焉五日，顏淵後，子曰：「吾以汝為死矣。」顏淵曰：「子在，回何敢死！」匡人拘孔子益急，弟子懼。孔子曰：「文王既沒，文不在茲乎？天之將喪斯文也，後死者不得與于斯文也。天之未喪斯文也，匡人其如予何！」孔子使從者為甯武子臣於衞，然後得去。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p034","quote":"孔子學鼓琴師襄子，十日不進。師襄子曰：「可以益矣。」孔子曰：「丘已習其曲矣，未得其數也。」有間，曰：「已習其數，可以益矣。」孔子曰：「丘未得其志也。」有間，曰：「已習其志，可以益矣。」孔子曰：「丘未得其為人也。」有間，有所穆然深思焉，有所怡然高望而遠志焉。曰：「丘得其為人，黯然而黑，幾然而長，眼如望羊，如王四國，非文王其誰能為此也！」師襄子辟席再拜，曰：「師蓋云文王操也。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p050","quote":"昭王將以書社地七百里封孔子。楚令尹子西曰：「王之使使諸侯有如子貢者乎？」曰：「無有。」「王之輔相有如顏回者乎？」曰：「無有。」「王之將率有如子路者乎？」曰：「無有。」「王之官尹有如宰予者乎？」曰：「無有。」「且楚之祖封於周，號為子男五十里。今孔丘述三五之法，明周召之業，王若用之，則楚安得世世堂堂方數千里乎？夫文王在豐，武王在鎬，百里之君卒王天下。今孔丘得據土壤，賢弟子為佐，非楚之福也。」昭王乃止。其秋，楚昭王卒于城父。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名、字、對話自稱、世系及附贊局部對應；世系求與冉求分開，武不接漢武帝，今皇帝與高皇帝不補姓名。子路仲由明示同指另存，冉有冉求與秦繆秦穆仍待核；附贊不當獨立作者正文或獨立見證。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p022","text":"將適陳，過匡，顏刻為僕，以其策指之曰：「昔吾入此，由彼缺也。」匡人聞之，以為魯之陽虎。陽虎嘗暴匡人，匡人於是遂止孔子。孔子狀類陽虎，拘焉五日，顏淵後，子曰：「吾以汝為死矣。」顏淵曰：「子在，回何敢死！」匡人拘孔子益急，弟子懼。孔子曰：「文王既沒，文不在茲乎？天之將喪斯文也，後死者不得與于斯文也。天之未喪斯文也，匡人其如予何！」孔子使從者為甯武子臣於衞，然後得去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"顏刻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002895","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m022-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m